"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, another_crab.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. BepInEx will then be downloaded into the ACT core files, along with the required mod DLL, which will be placed in Another Crab's Treasure\\BepInEx\\plugins. Then 'BepInEx.cfg' config file will be created with the Logging option enabled.",
